  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products: We offer c<span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.81);font-family:Inter, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">eremonial cacao. It is more than just a drink - it’s a natural, bioactive superfood with a history that spans centuries. Packed with over 100 nutrients, antioxidants, and compounds that support energy, focus, cardiovascular health, hormone balance, and mood, it’s a true gift from nature.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different: Ceremonial cacao and typical store-bought cacao powder <strong>may come from the same plant, but the similarities end there.</strong><br>Ceremonial cacao is made from <strong>high-quality, minimally processed cacao beans, carefully roasted or sometimes raw, and ground in a way that preserves its nutrients</strong>, antioxidants, and natural bioactive compounds. It’s designed to support energy, focus, mood, and overall wellness.<br>The name “ceremonial” comes from the cacao’s traditional use in rituals and mindful practices. <strong>Like ceremonial-grade matcha</strong>, it’s intended to be prepared and consumed in a way that honors its history and allows you to fully benefit from its nutrients and effects. In contrast, most <strong>commercial cacao powders are heavily processed</strong>, often alkalized, and may contain additives like sugar and have reduced nutrient content. They are usually intended for flavor only, with all or much of the cacao’s natural minerals, antioxidants, and health-promoting compounds removed.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">In short, ceremonial cacao is a nutrient-rich, bioactive product that supports both body and mind, while regular cacao powder is primarily for taste with zero benefits.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn: Get 10% of commission every-time someone buys our product through your unique link. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us: Try our cacao yourself, fall in love with it, and you wont be able to stay quiet about its amazing qualities. </p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• Other information: Learn more about us www.radecacao.com. We are not just a brand, we are growth minded, heart driven individuals, with a mission to create this world a better place. </p></div></div>",
